{"availability":"available","full":"innocenat/kindle-epub-fix","name":"kindle-epub-fix","description":"A simple Javascript website to fix common EPUB problem for Amazon's Send to Kindle.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":398,"forks":64,"created":"2022-07-13T15:16:25Z","updated":"2023-08-26T17:59:11Z","license":"Unlicense","branch":"master","homepage":"https://kindle-epub-fix.netlify.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://kindle-epub-fix.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T21:07:54.633Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T21:07:54.633Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T21:07:54.633Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T21:07:54.633Z","stars":398,"forks":64}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Amazon Send-to-Kindle service has accepted EPUB, however, for historical reason it still assumes ISO-8859-1 encoding if no encoding is specified. This creates weird formatting errors for special characters.","This tool will try to fix your EPUB by adding the UTF-8 specification to your EPUB. It currently does not fix other errors.","Warning: This tool come at no warranty. Please still keep your original EPUB. We don't guarantee the resulting file will be valid EPUB file, but it should."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/innocenat/kindle-epub-fix/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"e730367a4929947b372681bee430ca273f1ddf235e8fc2ce1e06505b825f12c8","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T21:07:54.818Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T21:07:54.818Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Amazon Send-to-Kindle service has accepted EPUB, however, for historical reason it still assumes ISO-8859-1 encoding if no encoding is specified. This creates weird formatting errors for special characters.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/innocenat/kindle-epub-fix/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e730367a4929947b372681bee430ca273f1ddf235e8fc2ce1e06505b825f12c8","sourceUrl"